  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u_8c16d576551015e503ef801d_0",
      "kind": "title",
      "source": "Split View",
      "sourceHash": "8c16d576551015e503ef801d3e9680a778546107240c3ba3b42a7d9e7a41a603",
      "context": "Split View",
      "contextHash": "0084cf9dc13fba28d316a1fa10d6af78afff3342a274732b477bd7474bd5eaaf",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a8bd495f7191e888f2e8c9bb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In Trilium, is possible to work with two or more notes side-by-side.",
      "sourceHash": "a8bd495f7191e888f2e8c9bb09a089b90d3aac7959f33c9470e0f0022c370128",
      "context": "Split View",
      "contextHash": "0084cf9dc13fba28d316a1fa10d6af78afff3342a274732b477bd7474bd5eaaf",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9d268b81055b115f134b54e2_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Interactions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9d268b81055b115f134b54e27711efe7d1c1fdc2f230b69737d2e8384171effc",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0a6b8ffd153ebc896fb3fd83_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button to the right of a note's title to open a new split to the right of it.",
      "sourceHash": "0a6b8ffd153ebc896fb3fd83ab30665b6580272203fb0b524f624d0a4437bdcd",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd67e0f97526b711d560dbeb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It is possible to have as many splits as desired, simply press again the button.",
      "sourceHash": "cd67e0f97526b711d560dbeb1610b650a7a067ae389c9048f6d50edc60471d74",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4a623713486d6c736f808762_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Only horizontal splits are possible, vertical or drag & dropping is not supported.",
      "sourceHash": "4a623713486d6c736f808762e1d91d995290e59b1f88c98f4e45bfa74ff2d6a6",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9b7960407da884b034802afa_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When at least one split is open, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button next to it to close it.",
      "sourceHash": "9b7960407da884b034802afab1aa380ca573f478adf0028266a66fa44c7f7d37",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_31c3db738f951ae3189f169b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Use the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ button to move around the splits.",
      "sourceHash": "31c3db738f951ae3189f169be98daec84b5edbe2392bd51c19a8510dad5b93bf",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d56ad84d6cf9522f39e367d3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Creating, closing and moving a split can also be triggered from a __TRILIUM_PH_0__keyboard shortcut__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__Create New Split__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Close Active Split__TRILIUM_PH_5__, __TRILIUM_PH_6__Move Split Left__TRILIUM_PH_7__ and __TRILIUM_PH_8__Move Split Right__TRILIUM_PH_9__, all unassigned by default) or through the __TRILIUM_PH_10__command palette__TRILIUM_PH_11__.",
      "sourceHash": "d56ad84d6cf9522f39e367d3295071f3301a716e5e8a2c10bbbfa62b735273c4",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c7566a3ee99146f66d06a7e0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The focus can be moved from one split to the one next to it with the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Focus Split to the Left__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Focus Split to the Right__TRILIUM_PH_3__ actions, which stop at either end of the tab instead of continuing into the next tab. They are unassigned by default as well.",
      "sourceHash": "c7566a3ee99146f66d06a7e0fd0480d7db0a5ed960ca88b4915ce7e9bf8a72a7",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cbd7f2e8795c9d9018a0a6d4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each __TRILIUM_PH_0__tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__ has its own split view configuration (e.g. one tab can have two notes in a split view, whereas the others are one-note views).",
      "sourceHash": "cbd7f2e8795c9d9018a0a6d4014da9c93f50f8c5f21d353a64f4417a46657017",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9a7cce9bda490a0e7801bfb9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The tab's title will indicate all the note titles, in the order of the splits from the left to right and separated by a bullet symbol.",
      "sourceHash": "9a7cce9bda490a0e7801bfb90e39c2653fd249964ca261e7ec77701cef4867b6",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8e28003ffee08eab469b55a8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The tab's icon will indicate the icon of the last active split, which will be automatically focused when clicking on the tab.",
      "sourceHash": "8e28003ffee08eab469b55a8ee03d8188d4d9c940da04c53f8d3b4157a1ede1d",
      "context": "Split View > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "a84db99bd11a488e2057ee23f3fb3a1935e76b2efa11bcd630c9993b3aac9d41",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c29c14b74fde5c667ff2d36f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Splits and the note tree & hoisting__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "c29c14b74fde5c667ff2d36f28d07c7ecf7cd1394202e07dd8521e33c8ae2f05",
      "context": "Split View > Splits and the note tree & hoisting",
      "contextHash": "fb114ed36966455f7d51a23b0c1a9f5f6cca36869e8ac8d6fb60425283a6af57",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_45016b87ed2afbee44aa0e17_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Clicking on the content of a split will focus that split. While focused, the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ will also indicate the note that is being edited.",
      "sourceHash": "45016b87ed2afbee44aa0e17ace8fe64c8fbbcfb95ec9fe249418dc71cd9ba84",
      "context": "Split View > Splits and the note tree & hoisting",
      "contextHash": "fb114ed36966455f7d51a23b0c1a9f5f6cca36869e8ac8d6fb60425283a6af57",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_80c75a50169e91bad75984e9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "It is possible for each of the splits to have their own __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Hoisting__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "80c75a50169e91bad75984e958efe8d8454f8d4caae5b6230bd53ff32085715d",
      "context": "Split View > Splits and the note tree & hoisting",
      "contextHash": "fb114ed36966455f7d51a23b0c1a9f5f6cca36869e8ac8d6fb60425283a6af57",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ed9cdae5fe65f500e99d01d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When a new split is created, it will share the same note hoisting as the previous one. An easy solution to this is to simply hoist the notes after the split is created.",
      "sourceHash": "9ed9cdae5fe65f500e99d01de15f17b89cb764a065aeea7fc42946307bde00fa",
      "context": "Split View > Splits and the note tree & hoisting",
      "contextHash": "fb114ed36966455f7d51a23b0c1a9f5f6cca36869e8ac8d6fb60425283a6af57",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_97d3c945d6a6ffa360d1397a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is generally quite useful for reorganizing notes from one place to the other, by hoisting the old place in the first split and hoisting the new place to the second one. This will allow easy cut and paste without the tree jumping around from switching between notes.",
      "sourceHash": "97d3c945d6a6ffa360d1397a81ad56fc38500dbdf7b06c027f1e2992a1144def",
      "context": "Split View > Splits and the note tree & hoisting",
      "contextHash": "fb114ed36966455f7d51a23b0c1a9f5f6cca36869e8ac8d6fb60425283a6af57",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d811f86b461cb28f75e7629e_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Mobile support__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d811f86b461cb28f75e7629ef3e87340602de43ec52a4e8d49520fe6f503cdb3",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e1363ffb24a259883ed917b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Since v0.100.0, it's possible to have a split view on the mobile view as well, with the following differences from the desktop version of the split:",
      "sourceHash": "4e1363ffb24a259883ed917b7c928f08118e867ad725d7466240ce1ab52b9f94",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bb441c870d5674353ade02cb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On smartphones, the split views are laid out vertically (one on the top and one on the bottom), instead of horizontally as on the desktop.",
      "sourceHash": "bb441c870d5674353ade02cb435a3760211a994d5970ccea2a50f65b3795acd7",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7fd6386fa29621464b5d65a8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "There can be only one split open per tab.",
      "sourceHash": "7fd6386fa29621464b5d65a8779d46bbf20f22956ee16058481f1f7c2d9fb5df",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4d0793c804213a4c27262d9a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It's not possible to resize the two split panes.",
      "sourceHash": "4d0793c804213a4c27262d9ae584424b2eb9080e5c8e030ec7981cfb2f9bd00a",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_21fc6562cbf4fea0101385b9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When the keyboard is opened, the active note will be “maximized”, thus allowing for more space even when a split is open. When the keyboard is closed, the splits become equal in size again.",
      "sourceHash": "21fc6562cbf4fea0101385b9fd7d346f27db0e1a9f9374cbc388c6cda62123f3",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fc4ae0b3d4843566243c61a7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Interaction:",
      "sourceHash": "fc4ae0b3d4843566243c61a706f07f3ad62a47bb4d3d2cc9caf2ef792bf1ba67",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_414f510d69cbb4ea257127c9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a new split, click the three dots button on the right of the note title and tap __TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__New split__TRILIUM_PH_2__ in the row of icons at the top.",
      "sourceHash": "414f510d69cbb4ea257127c9973fdfb9fd2c93600a1c04dda9b5a5b21f809842",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_75d8f5f64817ff2ba485ec5c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This option will only be available if there is no split already open in the current tab.",
      "sourceHash": "75d8f5f64817ff2ba485ec5cab8fa5f0cdf9f6fa20f2a87c8926034a679cc71e",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1cec201a25a9a702d96f7aa4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To close a split, click the three dots button on the right of the note title and select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Close this pane__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "1cec201a25a9a702d96f7aa4511fb7871212a1008208167fc3ee33c2baeef17d",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d2460e7a8940badba672ca6e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Note that this option will only be available on the second note in the split (the one at the bottom on smartphones, the one on the right on tablets).",
      "sourceHash": "d2460e7a8940badba672ca6e27a1400af780b847f97616a4a2cb1ee7a8552d88",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_91a7c96d6cda77c3a45933af_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When long-pressing a link, a contextual menu will show up with an option to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Open note in a new split__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "91a7c96d6cda77c3a45933af56adf8b54e684ec175523485d50ae3761575ee63",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dcc49de300d65c2a1cc9819f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If there's already a split, the option will replace the existing split instead.",
      "sourceHash": "dcc49de300d65c2a1cc9819fe7fa04b3787190eacd47964eca6c22c47fca5c0b",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b190d47815633246b0ab18a6_0",
      "kind": "image-alt",
      "source": "記事画像",
      "sourceHash": "b190d47815633246b0ab18a61d9b8e8ea36504fe3f8bc230a7753096915c9ff2",
      "context": "Split View > Mobile support",
      "contextHash": "45e080fdaf5416c05af5558e5abf61b221341deb97e6f05071692c8759cfc463",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
  ],
  "requests": []
}
